00:09:12.175 --> 00:09:15.775
what the length of the span is and all the major parameters.

00:09:16.255 --> 00:09:19.455
So basically the state of Connecticut has an estimating program

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:25.110
based on all the bridge contracts that have been let out within the last two years

00:09:25.510 --> 00:09:28.870
based on type to estimate what the costs will be.

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:32.070
So the costs have increased pretty dramatically.

00:09:33.065 --> 00:09:34.825
Before we were looking at

00:09:35.945 --> 00:09:37.785
$2,400,000

00:09:37.785 --> 00:09:41.465
for the design or for the build portion of it.

00:09:41.785 --> 00:09:44.665
