00:10:35.575 --> 00:10:36.375
that

00:10:37.095 --> 00:10:40.375
either bridge projects going forward or

00:10:40.375 --> 00:10:45.720
past bid bridge projects may be eligible for 100% federal funding.

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:48.040
Frankly don't know,

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:54.200
or some fraction less than the 20% match which we're required to do right now.

00:10:54.760 --> 00:10:55.000
So

00:10:55.565 --> 00:11:01.725
there's a chance that bill will go down and there's a chance that bill will remain at $600,000

00:11:02.525 --> 00:11:03.965
At the same time,

