00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:18.610
what I did was that we would be starting

00:11:18.850 --> 00:11:22.770
the paperwork roughly three years after we started the paperwork

00:11:22.930 --> 00:11:23.730
for

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:25.570
the Bunker Hill Bridge,

00:11:26.135 --> 00:11:28.375
