00:11:28.855 --> 00:11:30.455
2027,

00:11:30.455 --> 00:11:31.415
2028,

00:11:31.415 --> 00:11:32.375
2029

00:11:32.375 --> 00:11:32.935
for

00:11:33.335 --> 00:11:37.335
