00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:39.550
the delays.

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:45.470
The reason why I think it's appropriate to start it now is A, that bridge needs to be replaced and

00:11:45.710 --> 00:11:48.030
B, there's a chance that

00:11:49.150 --> 00:11:49.870
the

00:11:49.950 --> 00:11:55.175
