00:11:58.935 --> 00:12:05.495
that aren't yet in the program. So I want to have one that's starting that process right now.

00:12:05.895 --> 00:12:09.720
So if there if those are the ones that are going to fund completely,

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:12.440
