00:12:34.815 --> 00:12:42.320
Right now, you know there's about six months, five months delay in doing the paperwork and submitting it so I'm starting that process.

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:43.360
Now,

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:51.935
the other thing is that I'm planning on doing the exact same thing for two culvert projects,

00:12:52.335 --> 00:12:55.375
