>> Okay, I didn't actually realize this was going on the agenda, but I'll give you essentially an update up to this point.

01:09:53.535 --> 01:09:56.335
What has happened is the state of Connecticut

01:09:56.735 --> 01:10:02.010
has agreed to build a series of towers and build out the capacity

01:10:02.330 --> 01:10:04.170
for a statewide

01:10:04.170 --> 01:10:05.050
