01:10:05.050 --> 01:10:05.930
system

01:10:06.170 --> 01:10:09.530
that towns can adopt and become part of.

01:10:10.090 --> 01:10:10.649
Now,

01:10:11.770 --> 01:10:13.130
we've known this was

01:10:13.965 --> 01:10:18.124
a strong possibility in this area for about three years.

01:10:19.245 --> 01:10:21.245
