01:11:28.950 --> 01:11:35.510
The new system would be better. It would allow better communication between the fire department and DPW

01:11:35.590 --> 01:11:38.390
because their radio systems currently are not compatible,

01:11:40.375 --> 01:11:42.374
You know, which is kind of annoying,

01:11:42.535 --> 01:11:44.215
