02:14:53.190 --> 02:14:56.310
we take in fees for the sticker program

02:14:56.630 --> 02:14:57.670
roughly

02:14:59.510 --> 02:15:04.445
it works out to just under a quarter of the total expenses of the transfer station.

02:15:04.845 --> 02:15:07.645
So the sticker, the fees that people pay

02:15:08.045 --> 02:15:12.524
are for practical purposes, 25% of the cost of running the station.

