02:15:26.960 --> 02:15:33.855
One of the things that once we get through this budget year, because we're not doing anything on it this budget year,

02:15:34.255 --> 02:15:37.855
we probably should have a serious conversation

02:15:38.175 --> 02:15:40.815
with the company that bought out Willie Waste.

02:15:41.530 --> 02:15:45.450
